# Both files are pinned by a SHA-256 of their exact bytes (HydroCore/Tests/Vectors/SHA256),
# which the server and Android repositories also check, so git must never convert their
# line endings. Diff and merge stay textual so that rule changes can be reviewed; the
# HydroCore tests catch a merge that leaves the file and its hash out of step.
HydroCore/Tests/Vectors/* -text
